<title>USA: Halliburton approves 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Halliburton approves 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Halliburton Co said Tuesday that it has approved a two-for-one split of its common stock in the form of a stock dividend.</p>
<p>The company said the dividend would be paid to shareholders of record June 26.</p>
<p>Previously, Halliburton declared a $0.25 per share second quarter dividend on its common stock payable June 25, to shareholders of record June 4.</p>
<p>The common stock split, said the company, will follow the cash dividend.</p>
